) (Robinson test)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>187</span><span>188</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>203</span><span>204</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement and proof compared in supplied OCR; inconsistent theories satisfy both local sides vacuously"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-3.4.3"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory with model class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\\)</span> (model-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EC}_{\\mathcal K}\">\\(\\operatorname{EC}_{\\mathcal K}\\)</span> (existentially-closed predicate in a class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5dbb6e8d985aff7a\" href=\"?note=5dbb6e8d985aff7a\" title=\"17-df-existentially-closed\">17-df-existentially-closed</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{EC}_{\\operatorname{Mod}(T)}(\\mathfrak A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\operatorname{EC}_{\\operatorname{Mod}(T)}(\\mathfrak A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient class for existential closedness is exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span>; leaving the extension class implicit changes the statement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-existentially-closed","status":"resolved","id":"5dbb6e8d985aff7a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-existentially-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ (model-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-model-completeness]])","embed":f